meta {
  name: Create a workspace
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{bffUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Plataforma",
    "key": "PLAT",
    "description": "An example workspace",
    "tags": ["ativo"]
  }
}

docs {
  It requires the owner or admin role: creating a workspace reorganizes the whole
  account.

  The key is short and UPPERCASE — it is what prefixes a demand's identifier, and
  the core refuses any other form.

  **A workspace is OUR concept.** The task provider's "space" is something else, and
  it appears as `external_space_id` in the project's link.
}
